; Synthetic survey under a #PREFIX level whose names keep their case: cavern
; labels its stations XY:P1, XY:P2, XY:p1, XY:p2, XY:BB2 and XY:Bb2. P1/p1 and
; P2/p2 are case pairs 30 m apart, and BB2/Bb2 is a pair with no lowercase
; member. Nothing fixes it.
#PREFIX XY
#UNITS D=Meters A=Degrees V=Degrees DECL=0
P1	P2	10.0	90	0
P1	p1	30.0	0	0
p1	p2	10.0	90	0
P2	BB2	10.0	0	0
p2	Bb2	10.0	0	0
